source_text:
The {pilotnoun} known as {pilotname} was recently seen in the {sys} system. {fct} authorities want {pilotname} {deadoralive}{reason}. {pilotname} is believed to be flying a {shipclass}-class ship. {pilotname} may disappear if you take too long to reach the {sys} system.

#nTarget:#0 {pilotname} ({shipclass}-class ship{escorts})
#nWanted:#0 {wanted}
#nLast seen:#0 {sys} system
#nTime limit:#0 {deadline}

Defend the Jump
Distance: {d} {dunit}
Time left: {left:.1f}

A meddlesome {fct} pilot known as {plt} was recently seen in the {sys} system. Local crime lords want this pilot dead{reason}. {plt} is known to be flying a {shipclass}-class ship. The pilot may disappear if you take too long to reach the {sys} system.{msg}

#nTarget:#0 {plt} ({shipclass}-class ship{escorts})
#nWanted:#0 Dead
#nLast seen:#0 {sys} system
#nTime limit:#0 {deadline}

A local crime boss has offered a job to patrol the {sys} system in an effort to keep outsiders from discovering this Pirate stronghold. You will be tasked with checking various points and eliminating any outsiders along the way.

#nPatrol System:#0 {sys}
#nPatrol Points:#0 {amount}

"I would be able to provide my special services for, let's say, {cost}, how does that sound?"

{upgrade_desc}

You have {amount}. Pay {cost} for {upgrade}?

"It seems like I have already upgraded your current ship with {replacement}. Would you like to replace it with {upgrade} for 2 Encrypted Data Matrices?"

{upgrade_desc}

You have {amount}. Pay {cost} for replacing {replacement} with {upgrade}?

{msg}

This action will bribe {n} {fct_list} pilot.
You have {credits}. Pay #r{price}#0?

{msg}

This action will bribe {n} {fct_list} pilots.
You have {credits}. Pay #r{price}#0?

A Thurion agent has prepared some {cargoname} that have to be extracted. #rThe cargo is illegal to possess and must be delivered without raising suspicions.#0

#nAmount:#0 {amount}
#nPickup:#0 {spb} ({sys} system, )
#nDelivery:#0 {returnspb} ({returnsys} system)
#nJumps (One-way):#0 {dist}
#nReputation Gained:#0 {rep}

You look around and believe that the place will make an OKish new home for the orphans for the following reason:
{reason}
However, it may be better to try to locate a more fitting environment for them to grow up in.

